      "title": "机甲的反叛·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34313001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "天好阴沉，看起来快下雨了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "采购任务已完成，该返程了……嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么了，蒂娅？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "那边的大猫……好像在被什么东西追？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "等一下，这边的情况不太对劲！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机甲战车",
          "text": "Gamma-0发现目标，呼叫Gamma小队其他成员。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机甲坦克",
          "text": "指令已接收，歼灭模式启动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "突然涌出来了很多机甲战车……来源是路边的物流仓库吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么会这样？\n它们不怕被别的人类看到吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "看样子是冲着我们来的……数目越来越多了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "异乡人，准备战斗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我联系下管理局……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "有目标被摧毁了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "哈哈哈哈，这些孱弱的量产机真是不堪一击！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "杰斯……和莉莉奈？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "哼，笨蛋主人的救星登场了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "要不是更笨蛋的傻瓜哥哥刚才在等动画片播完，我们早就到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "杰斯",
          "text": "这个世界上只有我们两台机甲是有用的，其余都是废物！\n让我碾碎它们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "呜——和阴沉的瘦大姐那次情况好像，不会又是什么恶心AI在搞鬼吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "……虽然他们有点奇怪，这种时候当然援军是越多越好的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "嗯，一起战斗吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "看起来，今天彻底没客人了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "但还算是营业高峰期，毕竟门口都被堵上了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你会讲冷笑话了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "外面的事情希塔她们会处理，我们管好咖啡馆吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "那先把店门前的机甲清理掉吧，看得心烦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "一杯咖啡的时间，然后交换。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我同意……嗯哼？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "似乎我们有帮手了……有个独臂的武士正在机甲群里冲锋陷阵呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "果然，一出来就被包围了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313032",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>雷达IFF状态更新，敌对目标数量为120……更新，145，更新，168。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "数量还在持续增加，这样打下去会没完没了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "当务之急是把那个讨厌的兔子揪出来……能定位到它吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "可以试试。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机甲坦克",
          "text": "吱吱，有外部链接侵入……侵入……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "好厉害，近处的两台都不动了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "果然……他们也感染了同样的AI病毒，被黑幕操控了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "机甲集群共享着同一个指挥网络，信号的源头应该就是黑幕的所在地。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "那就好办了，去那边把兔子打倒，应该就能结束这场混乱了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313041",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>解析信号源坐标……完成。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……是FULI大厦的手办仓库。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "好，上来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313044",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313045",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "上车，我载你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313046",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "可是，你骑的不是单轮机车吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313047",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "别忘了，「阿尔贝尔」可是我亲自组装的一台——机甲啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313048",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "居然，变形出车轮了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313049",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "怕被甩下去的话就抱紧我——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34313050",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "现在开始，就是疾驰的时间了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-799",
