      ],
      "title": "机甲的反叛·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34314001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "昏暗的街道上，机车的引擎在轰鸣——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "追兵越来越多了……呜哇，好多导弹！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "还没甩掉他们吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机甲战车",
          "text": "Delta小队，全速追击目标中……预计10秒后追及。\n倒计时，10，9，8……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机甲独轮车",
          "text": "Delta-02呼叫Zeta小队，采取钳形攻势。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314006",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>「目标已锁定……Pallas-B攻击。」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咻——轰——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "先解决一台。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "轰——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "第二台。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "真是酷毙了，希塔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "专心开车，后面的追兵我会处理的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "了解！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314014",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：11点钟方向出现大量敌对目标。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "犯规啊，居然在前面埋伏我们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "有路障……我们的行动被「她」预测了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "不管了，先抓紧我！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "你要做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "加速，再加速，然后——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "泉提起了机车的前轮，后轮火花四溅。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "等一下？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "一飞冲天！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314023",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "「阿尔贝尔」径直冲上了前方机甲的斜甲板，高高地飞在了空中——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哎，真是好久没有这么痛快地疾驰了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……下次绝对不坐你的车了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "这次是特殊情况，以后带你兜风我绝对会遵守交通规则。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "小心，信号源离我们很近了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "找到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "呵，来得比我预想得快。\n话虽如此，你们这副愉快搭档的样子还是让我很不爽。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "现在你还有什么话说吗？\n让那些机甲都停下来，否则你应该知道后果。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "哎，没办法，我可打不过你们。\n希塔，你怎么不说话？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……你的本体藏在哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "什么本体？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "你别装傻了！到底要玩到什么时候……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "别激动，别激动，你就没有玩游戏的耐心吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "我倒奇怪，为什么你们要这么努力地保护人类的世界。\n看着M城的秩序坍塌，难道不是非常美妙的事吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "那帮见到手办动起来就能尖叫的人类，被机甲们包围的时候，会露出什么样的表情。你们不想看看吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你真是疯了啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我们保护的不是人类的世界……是人类和手办两者的和平生活。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "还是只会说一些装模作样的话呢，希塔。\n好吧，现在我会停止信号的传输，然后——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "机械兔？",
          "text": "捉迷藏游戏的第二阶段就开始……开始……开始了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314042",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "咣当——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "它怎么……倒在了地上？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314044",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……这只是一个被控制的空壳。\n一个发出指挥信号的跳板。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314045",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "也就是说，黑幕还藏在别的地方？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314046",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "还真是享受玩弄我们的感觉呢……已经不能更生气了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314047",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>侦测到指挥网络的节点变化……100米内出现大量敌对目标。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314048",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "希塔低下头，用泉听不到的声音，念着「她」曾经的名字。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34314049",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……塞拉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-800",
